msgctxt "210\tGROUP"
msgid "All"
msgstr "Todos"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216\tGROUP"
msgid "Tojo and Ueno Seiwa Clan War"
msgstr "Guerra entre el Tojo y Clan Ueno Seiwa"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "247\tGROUP"
msgid "Kamurocho Serial Murders"
msgstr "Asesinos Seriales de Kamurocho"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "274\tGROUP"
msgid "Yoshiharu Ueno Assassination"
msgstr "Asesinato de Yoshiharu Ueno"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "305\tGROUP"
msgid "Tojo Clan's Missing 10 Billion"
msgstr "Los 10 Mil Millones Desaparecidos Del Clan Tojo"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "426\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "People living in Kamurocho as of March 2010."
msgstr "Personas viviendo en Kamurocho en Marzo de 2010."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "473\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "People related to the events taking place in Kamurocho as of March 2010."
msgstr "Personas relacionadas a los eventos de Kamurocho en Marzo de 2010."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "People who live in Kamurocho and the people related to them."
msgstr "Gente viviendo en Kamurocho y personas relacionadas a ellos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "611\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "People involved in the Tojo and Ueno Seiwa Clan\nwar, which started when Arai of Kanemura\nEnterprises fatally shot Ihara of the Ueno Seiwa Clan."
msgstr "Personas involucradas en la guerra deñ clan Tojo y Ueno Seiwa, que comenzó cuando Arai de Empresas Kanemura\nmataron a tiros a Ihara, del clan Ueno Seiwa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "757\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "People involved in a recent string of mysterious\nmurders that took place in Kamurocho."
msgstr "Personas involucradas en la reciente serie de misteriosos asesinatos en Kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "846\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "People involved in the incident 25 years ago when\nSaejima of the Sasai Family gunned down 18 Ueno\nSeiwa Clan members, including Chairman Ueno."
msgstr "Personas involucradas en el incidente hace 25 años, cuando Saejima de la familia Sasai mató a tiros a 18 Ueno\nMiembros del Clan Seiwa, incluido el Presidente Ueno."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "991\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "People involved in the incident 5 years ago when 10\nbillion yen went missing from the Tojo Clan－leading\nto the explosion at the Millennium Tower."
msgstr "Las personas involucradas en el incidente hace 5 años, cuando 10 mil millones de yenes desaparecieron del Clan Tojo- llevando a la explosión en la Torre Millennium."

